# nb02 — SM8 random walk (GPU)  
Research‑grade return‑probability generator

This notebook:
- Loads a graph from an edge list
- Builds a compact neighbor representation
- Runs a GPU‑accelerated random walk
- Computes the return probability P(t)
- Writes results to CSV
- Produces diagnostic plots (log–log, linear)

